augmentFilling -- append an entry to a column of a Filling
**********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        augmentFilling(T, c, e)
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note Filling: Filling,, 
      * c, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, column index
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, entry to append
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Filling: Filling,, a new filling where e
        has been appended to the bottom of column c, or (if c >= #T) a new
        rightmost column {e} has been created

Description
===========

This is the natural cell-adding operation for Schur-functor combinatorics:
extending a filling by one cell at the bottom of column $c$ (or creating a new
rightmost column if $c$ is past the current rightmost column).  It is the
building block used to describe Schur-module maps by their action on tableaux;
see for example the Koszul-style differential built in the example of *note
schurModulesMap: schurModulesMap,.

+--------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = new Filling from {{0,1}, {1}}|
|                                      |
|     +-+-+                            |
|o1 = |0|1|                            |
|     |1| |                            |
|     +-+-+                            |
|                                      |
|o1 : Filling                          |
+--------------------------------------+
|i2 : T                                |
|                                      |
|     +-+-+                            |
|o2 = |0|1|                            |
|     |1| |                            |
|     +-+-+                            |
|                                      |
|o2 : Filling                          |
+--------------------------------------+
|i3 : augmentFilling(T, 0, 2)          |
|                                      |
|     +-+-+                            |
|o3 = |0|1|                            |
|     |1| |                            |
|     |2| |                            |
|     +-+-+                            |
|                                      |
|o3 : Filling                          |
+--------------------------------------+
|i4 : augmentFilling(T, 1, 2)          |
|                                      |
|     +-+-+                            |
|o4 = |0|1|                            |
|     |1|2|                            |
|     +-+-+                            |
|                                      |
|o4 : Filling                          |
+--------------------------------------+
|i5 : augmentFilling(T, 5, 3)          |
|                                      |
|     +-+-+-+                          |
|o5 = |0|1|3|                          |
|     |1| | |                          |
|     +-+-+-+                          |
|                                      |
|o5 : Filling                          |
+--------------------------------------+

