augmentWeylFilling -- append an entry to a row of a WeylFilling
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        augmentWeylFilling(T, r, e)
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note WeylFilling: WeylFilling,, 
      * r, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, row index
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, entry to append
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note WeylFilling: WeylFilling,, a new filling
        where e has been appended to the end of row r, or (if r >= #T) a new
        final row {e} has been created

Description
===========

The Weyl analogue of *note augmentFilling: augmentFilling,.  Where *note
Filling: Filling, is column-indexed, WeylFilling is row-indexed; this routine
grows a tableau by one cell in the natural row-wise direction and is the basic
building block for describing Weyl-module maps tableau-by-tableau (see the
example of *note weylModulesMap: weylModulesMap,).

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : T = weyl {{0,1},{2}}       |
|                                |
|     +-+-+                      |
|o1 = |0|1|                      |
|     |2| |                      |
|     +-+-+                      |
|                                |
|o1 : WeylFilling                |
+--------------------------------+
|i2 : augmentWeylFilling(T, 0, 2)|
|                                |
|     +-+-+-+                    |
|o2 = |0|1|2|                    |
|     |2| | |                    |
|     +-+-+-+                    |
|                                |
|o2 : WeylFilling                |
+--------------------------------+
|i3 : augmentWeylFilling(T, 1, 3)|
|                                |
|     +-+-+                      |
|o3 = |0|1|                      |
|     |2|3|                      |
|     +-+-+                      |
|                                |
|o3 : WeylFilling                |
+--------------------------------+
|i4 : augmentWeylFilling(T, 2, 4)|
|                                |
|     +-+-+                      |
|o4 = |0|1|                      |
|     |2| |                      |
|     |4| |                      |
|     +-+-+                      |
|                                |
|o4 : WeylFilling                |
+--------------------------------+

