|               +-+-+                                                         |
|               |0|2| => 5                                                    |
|               |2| |                                                         |
|               +-+-+                                                         |
|               +-+-+                                                         |
|               |1|1| => 6                                                    |
|               |2| |                                                         |
|               +-+-+                                                         |
|               +-+-+                                                         |
|               |1|2| => 7                                                    |
|               |2| |                                                         |
|               +-+-+                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

The cached quotient projection / splitting satisfy f * finv == id_M by
construction:

+----------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : (f, finv, AT, ST) = toSequence M.cache#"Schur";|
+----------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : f * finv == id_M                               |
|                                                    |
|o9 = true                                           |
+----------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The partition lambda should be nonempty and weakly decreasing.  Entries of
lambda should not exceed rank E, or else the output module has rank 0.

