|o1 = true                                                                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : splitCharacter weylCharacter({{1,1,1}, {2}}, 4)                     |
|                                                                         |
|o2 = s      + s                                                          |
|      4,1,1    3,3                                                       |
|                                                                         |
|o2 : schurRing (QQ, s, 4)                                                |
