    map
  * *note weylNormalize: weylNormalize, -- sort each row of a WeylFilling into
    weakly-increasing order
  * *note isWeylStandard: isWeylStandard, -- test whether a WeylFilling is
    Weyl-semistandard
  * *note towardWeylStandard: towardWeylStandard, -- a single Garnir-style
    straightening step for Weyl fillings
  * *note standardWeylTableaux: standardWeylTableaux, -- all Weyl-semistandard
    tableaux of a given shape
  * *note maxWeylFilling: maxWeylFilling, -- the lex-largest Weyl-standard
    tableau of given shape
  * *note augmentWeylFilling: augmentWeylFilling, -- append an entry to a row
    of a WeylFilling
  * *note conjugate(WeylFilling): conjugate_lpWeylFilling_rp, -- transpose of a
    Weyl-stored Young tableau
  * *note weylModule: weylModule, -- Weyl module of a partition applied to a
    free module
